WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.147
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which word contains the digraph “sh”?

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.558
The answer is: ship. A digraph uses two letters to represent one sound.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:14.143
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which sentence uses “ship” correctly?

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.537
The answer is: The ship moves.. Make a meaningful sentence using a digraph word.
